      "description": "The misrepresentation of historical facts. The text overlay claims the prisoners were liberated by 'the ussr' (which is factually correct) but frames it in a misleading or trivializing way. This inaccuracy is part of the meme's hateful intent to distort the historical record and minimize the gravity of the Holocaust.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
