      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "suffering",
      "label": "the expression of profound trauma and deprivation",
      "description": "The three individuals in the image display clear signs of extreme physical and emotional suffering. Their gaunt faces, hollow eyes, and ragged clothing convey the trauma of Holocaust survival. Their expressions are not of happiness or resilience, but of exhaustion, despair, and the lingering horror of their ordeal. This suffering is the dominant emotional expression in the visual material.",
